msgid "We all have parts to ourself that we fear to show to others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We all have talents, things we're just naturally good at, and environments where we feel most comfortable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We all only get this one life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "We alone see the world for what it is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "We are a proud people. It takes more than the raw strength of two legions to make us bend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Old Tribesman"
msgid "We are a warrior people. Strength...real or perceived...it is of great import."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We are all fools if we imagine that the four of us would undo centuries of distrust between our nations. Our peoples."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "We are all peers. I cannot force any of you to do as I ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "We are all victims here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "We are discussing if it is a trap or not. But the truth is, we are discussing a question to which we have no answer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We are divided. So let us rule. Not as one, but as many different parts of a whole."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We are each the rulers of our nations. We set the rules for this new Union that we are creating. It is whatever we say it to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "We are favored by the Gods, champions of their divine cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Dio"
msgid "We are free from our contract, our bindings, but what then? We are not free of need. Not free from money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "We are gathered here again to settle this final matter. The most important matter of all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Priest"
msgid "We are gathered to bless this union, between Marius and Sarah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "We are going to march on towards our destination, and the two of you will figure out the best way for the army to continue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "We are heading into a war. We will need someone who has military experience."
msgstr ""

